# MC-X-F12 (writer 9): the move of L4_3_band_move, rate's table governing 2027..: law-dated, so pay states at
# (L §4.3, §5.14: LOAD-LAWDATE).
=== m.tally
model p
  tally 2
  on 2027-12-31
  start 2027-01-01
  end 2027-12-31

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
source act "the act"
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2020-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input age3: int
input pay_day: date
band rate(a: int): money PLN

move pay: transfers
  on pay_day
  leg cash from world to konto amount rate(age3)

ask q: bal(konto, 2027-12-31)

version v_act
  cite act
  governs 2027..
  known 2026-12-01
  rate: [0, 6) = 400.00 PLN "under 6"
  rate: [6, 18) = 250.00 PLN "6 to 17"

version v_f
  cite act
  governs always
  known 2026-12-01
  age3 = 3 "the age"
  pay_day = 2027-02-01
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2027-01-01 start
=== expect
refused: LOAD-LAWDATE pay reads law-dated facts and states no at (m.tally:16)
